{"seq":13,"slug":"communications-engineering","title":"通信工程","stage":"DONE","chapterCount":4,"docCount":12,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering","introHtml":"<h1 id=\"通信工程-简介\">通信工程 简介</h1><p>通信工程研究的核心问题只有一个：如何把信息从一个地方可靠、高效、安全地送到另一个地方。无论是你拨打的电话、刷的短视频，还是火星探测器传回地球的照片，背后都是同一套科学——如何用电磁波、光或电信号承载信息，如何对抗噪声和干扰，如何让有限的频谱和带宽服务尽可能多的人。从一百多年前莫尔斯发出第一封电报，到今天 5G 让数十亿设备同时在线，通信工程一直是现代社会的&quot;神经系统&quot;。</p>\n<p>这门学科最迷人的地方在于，它把抽象的数学（傅里叶变换、概率论、信息论）和具体的工程实践（电路、天线、芯片、协议）紧密结合在一起。香农在 1948 年用一个公式 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>B</mi><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">S</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">N</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C = B\\log_2(1+\\mathrm{SNR})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathrm\">SNR</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 就划定了任何通信系统传输速率的理论上限，这种&quot;用数学预言物理极限&quot;的力量，正是通信工程的思维内核。学习它，你会逐渐理解为什么 Wi-Fi 在墙后会变慢、为什么手机在地铁里会断线、为什么光纤能跨越大洋传输海量数据。</p>\n<p>本学习空间将通信工程的核心内容组织为四个章节，由浅入深、由理论到系统。<strong>第一章 信号与系统基础</strong> 建立分析信号的数学工具，讲解时域与频域、傅里叶变换、采样定理和滤波——这是理解一切通信技术的语言。<strong>第二章 通信原理</strong> 进入通信的核心机制，涵盖模拟与数字调制、信源与信道编码，以及香农信息论奠定的理论基石。<strong>第三章 无线与移动通信</strong> 聚焦看不见的电磁波世界，讨论无线传播、天线与多址技术，以及从 1G 到 5G 的移动通信演进。<strong>第四章 网络与现代通信系统</strong> 把视野扩展到系统层面，讲解通信网络与协议、光纤通信，以及物联网与卫星通信等前沿应用。</p>\n<p>学习通信工程最有效的方法是&quot;信号跟踪&quot;——拿起任何一个你熟悉的通信场景（比如一次微信语音通话），尝试沿着信息的旅程追问：声音如何变成电信号？怎样被压缩编码？用什么方式调制到无线电波上？经过哪些网络节点？这种把抽象原理映射到真实系统的训练，能帮你把零散的知识点串成完整的认知地图。同时，建议动手用 Python 或 MATLAB 做一些信号仿真，亲眼看到傅里叶变换、调制波形和误码率曲线，理论会变得无比直观。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"signals-and-systems","title":"第一章 信号与系统基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/signals-and-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"signals-and-systems-basics","title":"大学通信工程 — 信号与系统基础概念","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/signals-and-systems/signals-and-systems-basics"},{"seq":2,"slug":"fourier-analysis","title":"大学通信工程 — 傅里叶分析与频域","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/signals-and-systems/fourier-analysis"},{"seq":3,"slug":"sampling-and-filtering","title":"大学通信工程 — 采样定理与滤波器","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/signals-and-systems/sampling-and-filtering"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"communication-principles","title":"第二章 通信原理","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"modulation","title":"大学通信工程 — 调制技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles/modulation"},{"seq":2,"slug":"coding","title":"大学通信工程 — 信源编码与信道编码","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles/coding"},{"seq":3,"slug":"information-theory","title":"大学通信工程 — 香农信息论","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/communication-principles/information-theory"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"wireless-and-mobile","title":"第三章 无线与移动通信","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/wireless-and-mobile","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"wireless-propagation-and-antennas","title":"大学通信工程 — 无线传播与天线","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/wireless-and-mobile/wireless-propagation-and-antennas"},{"seq":2,"slug":"multiple-access","title":"大学通信工程 — 多址技术","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/wireless-and-mobile/multiple-access"},{"seq":3,"slug":"mobile-generations-1g-to-5g","title":"大学通信工程 — 移动通信演进：从 1G 到 5G","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/wireless-and-mobile/mobile-generations-1g-to-5g"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"networks-and-systems","title":"第四章 网络与现代通信系统","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/networks-and-systems","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"networks-and-protocols","title":"大学通信工程 — 通信网络与协议","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/networks-and-systems/networks-and-protocols"},{"seq":2,"slug":"optical-fiber-communication","title":"大学通信工程 — 光纤通信","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/networks-and-systems/optical-fiber-communication"},{"seq":3,"slug":"iot-and-satellite","title":"大学通信工程 — 物联网与卫星通信","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/engineering/communications-engineering/networks-and-systems/iot-and-satellite"}]}]}